{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Theming","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The payment sheet always renders with Mollie’s branded appearance."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no public API to customize colors, typography, or corner radius. Every entry point — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentCard(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly — always renders with the same Mollie-branded default theme."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let checkout = try MollieCheckout(clientToken: clientToken)","let result = await checkout.presentCard(from: viewController)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is intentional: it keeps the payment surface’s visual trust signals consistent across merchant integrations. If your integration needs a different look, embed ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" inside your own layout and style the surrounding chrome — the form itself is not restylable.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/theming"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MollieCardComponent":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Embeddable SwiftUI surface for the Mollie card form.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MollieCardComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MollieCardComponent","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliecardcomponent","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MollieCardComponent"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MollieCheckout":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MollieCheckout","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Single owner of a checkout’s session context — the client token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(both raw and decoded) plus the endpoints it talks to — vended once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and reused to present the card form either as a UIKit modal or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI component. The host owns presentation in both cases: this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type never presents a sheet on its own — ","type":"text"},{"code":"presentCard(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"presents modally from a host-supplied "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)"},{"type":"text","text":" vends an embeddable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host places inside its own layout (including its own "},{"code":".sheet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", if it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wants a modal presentation)."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliecheckout","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MollieCheckout","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"MollieCheckout"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents":{"title":"MollieComponents","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents","abstract":[{"text":"Accept card payments in your iOS app with a drop-in, PCI-aware payment UI — card tokenization and 3D Secure behind a single import.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents","role":"collection"}}}